---
pagination:
  data: blog.posts
  size: 1
  alias: post
permalink: "blog/posts/{{ post.slug }}.html"
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ja">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">

    <title>{{ post.title }} - 院長ブログ - 医療法人千心会 櫻井医院</title>
    <meta name="description" content="{{ post.excerpt | truncate(110) }}">
    <link rel="canonical" href="https://sakurai-crc.org/blog/posts/{{ post.slug }}.html">
    <meta property="og:title" content="{{ post.title }} - 院長ブログ - 医療法人千心会 櫻井医院">
    <meta property="og:description" content="{{ post.excerpt | truncate(110) }}">
    <meta property="og:image" content="https://sakurai-crc.org/{{ post.image | replace('../', '') }}">
    <meta property="og:url" content="https://sakurai-crc.org/blog/posts/{{ post.slug }}.html">
    <meta property="og:type" content="article">

    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
    <link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Sans+JP:wght@400;500;700&family=Lora:ital,wght@0,400;0,600;1,400&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
    <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/icon?family=Material+Icons" rel="stylesheet">
    <link rel="manifest" href="../../manifest.json">
    <link rel="stylesheet" href="../../css/blog_styles.css">

</head>
<body>

    <header class="blog-header">
        <div class="header-container">
            <a href="../dr-blog.html" class="blog-title-link" style="text-decoration: none; display: flex; align-items: center;">
                <div class="blog-title">
                    <img src="../../images/logo-sakurai-clinic.png" alt="櫻井医院ロゴ" class="blog-logo-pc">
                    <img src="../../images/logo-small.png" alt="櫻井医院ロゴ" class="blog-logo-sp">
                    <div class="blog-title-text">
                        <h1>院長ブログ</h1>
                        <span class="subtitle">櫻井繁樹の医療ノート</span>
                    </div>
                </div>
            </a>
            <a href="../dr-blog.html" class="return-to-site">ブログ一覧へ戻る</a>
        </div>
    </header>

    <main class="blog-container">

        <div class="blog-main">
            <article class="blog-post post-full" id="post-container">
                <header class="post-header" style="padding: 20px 20px 0;">
                    <div class="post-meta">
                        <div class="post-date">
                            <svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" width="16" height="16" fill="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 16 16"><path d="M8 3.5a.5.5 0 0 0-1 0V9a.5.5 0 0 0 .252.434l3.5 2a.5.5 0 0 0 .496-.868L8 8.71V3.5z"/><path d="M8 16A8 8 0 1 0 8 0a8 8 0 0 0 0 16zm7-8A7 7 0 1 1 1 8a7 7 0 0 1 14 0z"/></svg>
                            {{ post.dateJa }}
                        </div>
                        <div class="post-categories">{% for cat in post.categories %}<span class="post-category">{{ cat }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
                    </div>
                    <h1 class="post-title" style="font-size: 2em; margin-top: 15px;">{{ post.title }}</h1>
                </header>
                <figure class="post-image-container" style="margin: 20px 0;">
                    <img src="{{ post.image | replace('../', '../../') }}" alt="{{ post.alt }}" class="post-image" style="height: auto; max-height: 400px; object-fit: contain; display: block; margin: 0 auto; border-radius: 8px;">
                </figure>
                <section class="post-full-content">
                    {{ post.bodyHtml | safe }}
                </section>
                <footer class="post-footer" style="padding: 0 20px 20px;">
                    <div class="post-tags">{% for tag in post.tags %}<span class="post-tag">{{ tag }}</span>{% endfor %}</div>
                </footer>
            </article>
            </div>

        <aside class="blog-sidebar">
            <div class="sidebar-section profile-section">
                <img src="../../images/doctor_blog.jpg" alt="櫻井繁樹院長" class="profile-image">
                <h3 class="profile-name">櫻井 繁樹</h3>
                <p class="profile-title">循環器内科医・院長</p>
                <p class="profile-bio">群馬大学医学部卒業。循環器内科医として30年以上,診療に携わり、特に心臓リハビリテーションを専門としています。このブログでは、医療情報や健康に関する話題を分かりやすくお伝えしたいと思います。</p>
            </div>
            <div class="sidebar-section">
                <h3 class="sidebar-title">カテゴリー</h3>
                <ul class="category-list">
{%- for cat in blog.categories %}
                <li><a href="../template-category.html?name={{ cat | urlencode }}"><i class="material-icons category-icon">folder_open</i><span>{{ cat }}</span></a></li>
{%- endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="sidebar-section">
                <h3 class="sidebar-title">アーカイブ</h3>
                <ul class="archive-list">
{%- for m in blog.months %}
                <li><a href="../template-archive.html?month={{ m }}"><i class="material-icons category-icon">calendar_today</i><span>{{ m.slice(0,4) }}年{{ m.slice(5,7) | int }}月</span></a></li>
{%- endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="sidebar-section">
                 <h3 class="sidebar-title">タグ</h3>
                <ul class="tag-list">
{%- for t in blog.tags %}
                <li><a href="../template-tag.html?tag={{ t | urlencode }}">{{ t }}</a></li>
{%- endfor %}
                </ul>
            </div>
            <div class="sidebar-section">
                 <h3 class="sidebar-title">クリニックからのお知らせ</h3>
                 <ul class="category-list">
                     <li><a href="../../index.html#news"><i class="material-icons category-icon">campaign</i><span>今年も健診が始まります</span></a></li>
                     <li><a href="../../index.html#news"><i class="material-icons category-icon">campaign</i><span>ゴールデンウィーク期間の診療について</span></a></li>
                     <li><a href="../../index.html#news"><i class="material-icons category-icon">campaign</i><span>在宅心臓リハビリ支援プログラム開始</span></a></li>
                     <li><a href="../../telemedicine.html"><i class="material-icons category-icon">campaign</i><span>オンライン診療のご案内</span></a></li>
                 </ul>
             </div>
        </aside>
    </main>

    <footer class="blog-footer">
        <div class="footer-container">
            <nav class="footer-nav">
                <a href="../../index.html">クリニックホーム</a>
                <a href="../../index.html#services">診療内容</a>
                <a href="../../access.html">アクセス</a>
                <a href="../../contact.html">お問い合わせ</a>
                <a href="../../privacy-policy.html">プライバシーポリシー</a>
            </nav>
            <p class="copyright">© 2025 医療法人千心会 櫻井医院 All Rights Reserved.</p>
        </div>
    </footer>
</body>
</html>